rules.json contains 52 unmodified rule documents referenced by the pinned
internal/config/rules/system_rules.json. The upstream ordered path map is retained;
brace alternatives were expanded into explicit patterns for the existing Python
path matcher. Packaging and metadata were generated for Verified Coding Agent Runtime.
The rules are supplemental guidance, not authoritative project instructions.
No upstream CLI, model loop, file filtering or custom rule loader is included.
